---
const points = [
  "Live transcription of both sides of the call",
  "Next-line suggestions the moment a prospect objects",
  "Follows your own scripts and offers, not generic templates",
  "Notes and outcomes saved to the lead automatically",
];
---

<section class="section spotlight">
  <div class="container spotlight__inner">
    <div class="spotlight__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">The unfair advantage</span>
      <h2 class="spotlight__title">An AI closer riding shotgun on every call</h2>
      <p class="spotlight__lede">
        Most lead tools stop at the list. Leadflow stays on the line — listening,
        transcribing, and feeding your rep the exact next line so an average day
        of dials starts closing like your best one.
      </p>
      <ul class="spotlight__points">
        {
          points.map((p) => (
            <li>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              <span>{p}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="spotlight__panel" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="line line--prospect"><span>Prospect</span><p>We already work with someone for that.</p></div>
      <div class="line line--rep"><span>You</span><p>Totally fair — how's that going for you so far?</p></div>
      <div class="line line--coach">
        <span>Coach</span>
        <p>Good opening. If they hesitate, ask what made them start looking in the first place — then offer a free lead audit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spotlight__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 56px;
  }

  .spotlight__title {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .spotlight__lede {
    margin: 18px 0 24px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .spotlight__points {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 13px;
  }

  .spotlight__points li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 11px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .spotlight__points svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    margin-top: 3px;
    padding: 2px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .spotlight__panel {
    background: var(--dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 26px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .line span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .line p {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 15px;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .line--prospect span {
    color: var(--dark-text-muted);
  }
  .line--prospect p {
    background: var(--dark-soft);
    color: var(--dark-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }

  .line--rep {
    justify-self: end;
    text-align: right;
    max-width: 82%;
  }
  .line--rep span {
    color: var(--dark-text-muted);
  }
  .line--rep p {
    background: #f0eee9;
    color: #1b1a17;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .line--coach span {
    color: #8fcb9b;
  }
  .line--coach p {
    background: rgba(99, 180, 137, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 180, 137, 0.3);
    color: #d7ecdd;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .spotlight__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
